  "headCont": "생물구성다양성",
  "contentval": "0000kzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/46",
  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요. 상봉중학교에 있는 김솔 입니다. 일년간 여기서 수업 아이디어를 참 많이 얻었는데 학기중엔 바빠서 올릴 틈이 없는데 저도 일년에 한 번 정도 수업 자료를 공유해 볼게요. 저는 생물다양성 포스터를 제작하여 교내 캠페인 (전시) 하는 3차시 수업을 진행하였고, 반응이 좋아서 나눕니다. 이 수업의 부제를 붙이자면.. 과학 관련 펀(pun, 말장난이라고 해야할까요?? <s>과학아재개그</s>?)를 통해 생물다양성 보존에 공감 하기 입니다. 초등학교에서 친구사랑 캠페인 을 할 때도 pun 을 이용해서 많이 한다고 친한 초등 교사 샘이 코멘트를 주었습니다.<b></b></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/028916e87970fa77e8cd3f03ca1fe8887371d928\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/028916e87970fa77e8cd3f03ca1fe8887371d928\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"990\"><div class=\"figcaption\">수업은 한시간에 생물 다양성을 표현할 수 있도록 포스터를 그리는 것입니다. (도화지와 포스터의 특성에 맞게 유성매직 을 부여하였습니다)</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/911f1d6b64519df57a0d502c3d46f967507ef205\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/911f1d6b64519df57a0d502c3d46f967507ef205\" data-origin-width=\"990\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"><div class=\"figcaption\">생물다읍성 ... 중요한 건 이렇게 pun 을 넣어 (소위 과학 아재개그) 포스터의 주목성을 높이고 생물 다양성 보존이 중요함을 인식시키는 것인데요, 아이들의 창의력이 놀랍습니다.</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5307478f34f54caa1848034fee565ddc03a8e9e3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5307478f34f54caa1848034fee565ddc03a8e9e3\" data-origin-width=\"990\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"><div class=\"figcaption\">이 남학생은 완성을 다 못했지만 아이디어가 괜찮아서 (진달래가 달래준다니 얼마나 섬세합니까 ㅠㅠ) 다시 그려오도록 했습니다</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e81f3c1ca8354c18ca80dcfd9fbac0364a33c174\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e81f3c1ca8354c18ca80dcfd9fbac0364a33c174\" data-origin-width=\"990\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"><div class=\"figcaption\">그림 그리기가 어려우면 교과서 보고 그리라고 하고, 교과서 보고 아이디어를 얻어 보라고 하면 애들이 알아서 잘 찾아 그립니다.</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e454afaf82fa1c0675bf80a538873a22f64c684\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e454afaf82fa1c0675bf80a538873a22f64c684\" data-origin-width=\"990\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"><div class=\"figcaption\">안지키면 난 너가 미역 ... 생물 다양성을 꼭 지켜야겠습니다.</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c17ad46a69a42f563be72b4830b923e5934ec03e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c17ad46a69a42f563be72b4830b923e5934ec03e\" data-origin-width=\"990\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"><div class=\"figcaption\">좋은 아이디어가 많으면 다른 반 진행할 때 들고가서 예시로 보여줍니다.</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b336862b8c5db92fdf16461e607c05df527143c6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b336862b8c5db92fdf16461e607c05df527143c6\" data-origin-width=\"990\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"><div class=\"figcaption\">이 친구도 아이디어가 좋아 그림을 다시 그려오라고 했습니다.</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6747810a5b5bde3ec97a869153790b406592145\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6747810a5b5bde3ec97a869153790b406592145\" data-origin-width=\"990\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"><div class=\"figcaption\">'남획'이라는 단어를 처음 배워 좋았나봅니다.</div></div><p>이렇게 해서 제가 200명의 작품 중 한 7 작품을 대상으로 먼저 뽑았고요. 전시를 하고 다음 몇가지 작품을 학생들이 직접 투표할 수 있게 하여서 2~3 차시 더 연장하여 진행했던 재미있던 시간이었습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ff4d57fe53774ff2a14a1a0762791d17b01c3120\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ff4d57fe53774ff2a14a1a0762791d17b01c3120\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"><div class=\"figcaption\">이렇게 아이들의 이름을 붙여서 전시하였습니다.</div></div><p>2차, 3차 우수작도 정해진 뒤에 이렇게 천연기념물 동물 포스터와 함께 붙였습니다. 제가 여기에다 아이들의 작품을 막 올려도 되는 것이지요..? (문제가 된다면 지우겠습니다) 수업 자료용으로 사용하셔도 얼마든지 환영합니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dfbf902931a317d4d12a962dd314935fab4d519d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dfbf902931a317d4d12a962dd314935fab4d519d\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"><div class=\"figcaption\">아이들이 직접 투표를 통해 선정한 작품들입니다. 이거 이제 이번주에 제거하러 가야함... 흑흑</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/43d7afdcd3f70b07ce2c1f36b8337e9b1fde78fd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/43d7afdcd3f70b07ce2c1f36b8337e9b1fde78fd\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1113\"><div class=\"figcaption\">이런 진지한 버젼도 있고요.</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/93710465169bc85cd692c6044f94174ef8fd4634\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/93710465169bc85cd692c6044f94174ef8fd4634\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"><div class=\"figcaption\">이것도 애들 투표에서는 떨어졌지만 교무실 선생님들에게 함박웃음을 줬던 ^^ (아재 감성)</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42514bafac4976bf296c8c17f1689e6d685c1431\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42514bafac4976bf296c8c17f1689e6d685c1431\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"><div class=\"figcaption\">이게 중학생 감성인가봅니다 인기가 많더라고요</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6f671d7e9690a0ae9736628bd754a99c1d404a24\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6f671d7e9690a0ae9736628bd754a99c1d404a24\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"><div class=\"figcaption\">이런 옛날 감성 포스터도 있습니다</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9959d8d180b8ce087982a6eafc42e96bc823716e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9959d8d180b8ce087982a6eafc42e96bc823716e\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"><div class=\"figcaption\">생물 다양성 5 글자만 있을 뿐인데 생물 다양성 감성이 생깁니다 포스터의 마법인듯 합니다</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dd9da6640dd265e91e9d6bc84ca9a90b8d8ed605\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dd9da6640dd265e91e9d6bc84ca9a90b8d8ed605\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"><div class=\"figcaption\">인기가 많았습니다</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/725996c12581bfbce473580a823186116932fc7c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/725996c12581bfbce473580a823186116932fc7c\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"><div class=\"figcaption\">시배스, 블랙배스, 모두 서양 외래 종 물고기 인데 ㅎㅎ 게임 에서 만 잡다가 교과서에는 외래종으로 나오네요 (물리전공이라 생물 을 잘 모름)</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/561b6c060d25bcafc562d21cd3af84beca6efdd5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/561b6c060d25bcafc562d21cd3af84beca6efdd5\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1113\"><div class=\"figcaption\">인기가 있었어요.</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ae26b57a04c1e7342b1cc323893180a70b958ef\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ae26b57a04c1e7342b1cc323893180a70b958ef\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"><div class=\"figcaption\">본인이 새로배운 것에 심취하여 포스터를 만든 학생 (공부 잘 하는 학생들은 산호가 동물이라는 것을 굉장히 신기해하더라고요)</div></div><p>여기부터는 그냥 학교의 분위기를 훈훈 하게 (?) 하기 위해 즐겁게 봐주세요!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba3ba0480c50b2a8c9001c4271b6a92c9714813d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba3ba0480c50b2a8c9001c4271b6a92c9714813d\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/820badeb560d72b19263d224313b8e9904149ff2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/820badeb560d72b19263d224313b8e9904149ff2\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"><div class=\"figcaption\">너무좋아요 ㅠ</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0fae77092eb60b096077fb1f47014f446717752e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0fae77092eb60b096077fb1f47014f446717752e\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7ff34ba92c90a359dac7db79e6dc25f886e945c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7ff34ba92c90a359dac7db79e6dc25f886e945c\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"><div class=\"figcaption\">포스터의 중요성은 다른 사람의 이목을 집중시키는 거라고 하니까 이렇게 그린 학생도 있습니다</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/107df28cdf3d9448503ab4e09db2211b045a8028\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/107df28cdf3d9448503ab4e09db2211b045a8028\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/37a4314b6495ded48193ceb7b68fbb09c26e5660\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/37a4314b6495ded48193ceb7b68fbb09c26e5660\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e73d2225e90fa08de3507192c18f810fa7fa111f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e73d2225e90fa08de3507192c18f810fa7fa111f\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9cb7915661303057317d64059a379796fc409a19\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9cb7915661303057317d64059a379796fc409a19\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/95b7bc894b538f809ab5e456b3fd6c80f4adcad8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/95b7bc894b538f809ab5e456b3fd6c80f4adcad8\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb97852ae39c4a29b2d42e44345e6b9d36cfc64a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb97852ae39c4a29b2d42e44345e6b9d36cfc64a\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07010f8d690dccf1cf8755fd8c259f55855221a7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07010f8d690dccf1cf8755fd8c259f55855221a7\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"1334\"><div class=\"figcaption\">종속과목강문계로 하트를 ㅎㅎ</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mo